#. お前が隠そうとしたのはＤＶＤだけじゃない。
#. この<CLT 3>集合写真<CLT>もそうだったはずだ。
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The video wasn't the only thing you tried to cover up.\n"
"You did the same thing with this <CLT 3>group photo<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. ド、ドキィイイッ！！
msgctxt "0002 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Uh—! Uh-ooooohh...!"
msgstr ""

#. さっき…みんなに配られた写真を見比べてる時に、
#. 気が付いたんだ。
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I noticed it just a little while ago, when we were all\n"
"comparing the photos we'd gotten."
msgstr ""

#. これらの集合写真に共通して見られる、
#. ある<CLT 3>不自然な点<CLT>に…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"In all the photos, there's a certain similarity, an\n"
"<CLT 3>unusual circumstance<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. な、何が不自然だってのさ！？
msgctxt "0005 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Wh-What's so unusual about them!?"
msgstr ""

#. 江ノ島盾子の顔
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Junko's face"
msgstr ""

#. 写真を受け取った本人
msgctxt "0007 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The ones who got the photos"
msgstr ""

#. その件は、今は関係ないわ。
#. しっかりして。
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"That really doesn't matter right now. Pull yourself\n"
"together."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに、しっかりしなくちゃ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She's right. I need to settle down...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最初に写真を見た時から、
#. 何かが引っ掛かってたんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There was something that bothered me when I was\n"
"looking at those pictures...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 戦刃むくろの顔
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Mukuro's face"
msgstr ""

#. 私達が江ノ島ちゃんだと思ってた顔…
#. でも、そうじゃなかった…？
msgctxt "0013 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Wait, so who we thought was Junko...wasn't?"
msgstr ""

#. なんだかもう、訳がわかんないよ…
msgctxt "0014 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I'm so confused..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今の朝日奈さんの発言って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What Hina said just now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>要するに、あの人の本当の顔は
#. 今もわからないって事だよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even now, we don't actually know what one of those\n"
"people really looks like...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. ねえ、もしかしてハッタリ？
msgctxt "0018 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "What, are you tryin' to bluff me!?"
msgstr ""

#. ねえ、もしかしてハッタリ？
msgctxt "0019 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "What, are you tryin' to bluff me!?"
msgstr ""

#. ねえ、もしかしてハッタリ？
msgctxt "0020 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "What, are you tryin' to bluff me!?"
msgstr ""

#. なーんだ、うぷぷぷ…
msgctxt "0021 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Whaaat? Puhuhu..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…ハッタリなんかじゃない。
#. この写真は、ある人物が写ってないんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's not a bluff! In all of these pictures, there's\n"
"someone who's not here...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>これらの集合写真に共通してみられる、
#. 不自然な点…それは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The unusual circumstance common to all these\n"
"pictures...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その<CLT><CLT 3>不自然な点<CLT><CLT 4>って言うのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The <CLT><CLT 3>unusual circumstance<CLT><CLT 4> is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>江ノ島盾子の顔<CLT>だよ…
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "<CLT 3>Junko's face<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 彼女の顔だけは、
#. どの写真にも共通して<CLT 3>写ってなかった<CLT>んだ。
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The one thing common to every single photo is that\n"
"<CLT 3>you can't see her face<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. １枚も写ってないなんて、
#. こんなの、どう考えても不自然過ぎる…
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It's hard to believe her face would just happen to be\n"
"hidden in every single picture, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

#. それに、この写真には戦刃むくろが写ってる…
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And on top of that, in this photo you can see that\n"
"Mukuro is clearly visible."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、この時、
#. ２人はまだ<CLT 3>入れ替わってなかった<CLT>んだ。
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So in other words, at that point, the two of them\n"
"<CLT 3>hadn't switched yet<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. だとすると、ここで顔を隠している江ノ島盾子は、
#. 間違いなく<CLT 3>本物<CLT>だったはず…
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"With all that in mind, there's no doubt that the girl\n"
"whose face is hidden here is the <CLT 3>real Junko<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. だからこそ、お前は江ノ島盾子の顔が写ってない写真を
#. 選んで渡す必要があったんだ。
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Which is why you had to have pictures that didn't show\n"
"her face."
msgstr ""

#. ここで江ノ島盾子の顔が見えていたら、
#. ボク達にバレてしまうからだ…
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Because if we could have seen her face, then it would\n"
"have clearly revealed..."
msgstr ""

#. この集合写真に写っている江ノ島盾子が、
#. ボク達の知っている江ノ島盾子じゃないって事がだ！
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...that the Junko in the pictures wasn't the Junko\n"
"that we knew!"
msgstr ""

#. …ざなどぅ！
msgctxt "0035 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Xanadu!"
msgstr ""

#. すべて…苗木君の言った通りのはずよ…
msgctxt "0036 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I believe everything Makoto said is true."
msgstr ""

#. …江ノ島盾子と戦刃むくろは、
#. 私達と会う前から入れ替わっていたのよ。
msgctxt "0037 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Junko and Mukuro switched places before we met either\n"
"of them."
msgstr ""

#. そして、入れ替わった戦刃むくろを殺す事で、
#. 自分が死んだと見せかけた、<CLT 3>本物の江ノ島盾子<CLT>は…
msgctxt "0038 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So she killed Mukuro, who had taken her place, making\n"
"it look like she'd died. And the <CLT 3>real Junko<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. 今も生きている…
msgctxt "0039 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...is still alive."
msgstr ""

#. その彼女こそが、コロシアイ学園生活の首謀者…
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And she's the one behind this whole murderous\n"
"situation, this \"killing game\"..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“超高校級の絶望”<CLT>と呼ばれる<CLT 3>黒幕の正体<CLT>なんだ！
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"She's the <CLT 3>true mastermind<CLT> and the <CLT 3>Ultimate\n"
"Despair<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. …ふぁざなどぅ！！
msgctxt "0042 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Xanadu times two!"
msgstr ""

#. …これで、黒幕の正体と、
#. その犯行は明らかになったわね。
msgctxt "0043 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"With this, the identity, and the crimes, of the\n"
"mastermind have been exposed."
msgstr ""

#. い、いやいや…！　ま、待ちなさいって…！
msgctxt "0044 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "N-No, wait...! Hold on!"
msgstr ""

#. 反論なんか無駄だぞ…
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Don't bother trying to deny it."
msgstr "Đừng cố chối cãi nữa..."

#. もう、どこにも…
#. お前が反論する余地なんて残されてないんだ。
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"There's no more room for debate. You don't have\n"
"anywhere left to run."
msgstr ""

#. 最後に…ボクがそれを証明してみせる！！
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'll prove everything...right now!"
msgstr ""
